== the merge commit's message
Merge develop 8861e6216 into ks-1078 — bring the branch to the current base

Two content conflicts, resolved:

- systemTest/__tests__/manifest_quarantine.test.sh:51-70 — the probe line.
  develop (3537c9828) prefixed it with `env -u SECUURA_STACK_SLOT -u STACK_SLOT
  -u SECUURA_ARTIFACT_SUFFIX`; this branch changed its redirect from `2>&1` to
  `2>"$TMP/probe.err"`. The merged line (now :66) carries develop's prefix AND
  this branch's redirect; the explanatory comment block above it is this
  branch's. Zero live `2>&1` redirects remain outside comments; both diagnostic
  lines (`stdout:` / `stderr:`) intact; `bash -n` clean. The three-arm stub
  red-proof on these exact bytes: arm 1 passes, arms 2a/2b still fire.
- BACKLOG.md:994-1029 — a both-append at the same anchor. develop's
  `smoke-test.sh section 6` item (cb2bae9f3) and this branch's
  `quarantine_call_sites.test.sh` item are both kept whole, develop's first
  (a ledger has no order dependency). 33 open items = develop's 32 + this
  branch's 1; every line of both sides is present.

No other file was touched by hand. The merge base was a1e49d151 (109 develop
commits behind); no fix rides in this commit.

